    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Uh huh, wait until you try riding a bike like me.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: And getting paid enough to barely survive, IN THIS ECONOMY?? No thanks~
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: You move around in the dirt so I don't have to, I respect that!
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Thanks. I guess.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 5
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 5
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: Alright enough praises, skedaddle! See you around.
